  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object of mass 10 kg is initially at rest at the top of a slope of length 50 m. A constant net force of 40 N acts on the object down the slope.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the object at the bottom of the slope?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">20 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">40 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">200 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">400 m s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
